        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://westonmillproject.com/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Weston Mill transitioned from a waterwheel to 19th‑century turbine engines, boosting output dramatically.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://westonmillproject.com/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Grist mills like Weston’s sparked town growth, prompting roads, bridges, houses, and schools to follow.",
